  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you talk about saving for a rainy day, what you mean is you hoard away poison for when you're going to need all of it at once. And maybe even then some; that's why you hoard it in the first place: it's never enough.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Assassin techniques class feature, stockpiling technique, poison as a chosen assassin specialization</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The stockpiling technique can now retain an additional +2 poison points, for a total of 5.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
